INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','Only the current controller of a prepared creature can cast the copy of its prepare spell in exile. It doesn''t matter who owns that creature or who controlled it when it became prepared.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','While copies of spells in zones other than the stack cease to exist when state-based actions are checked, this does not apply to copies of prepare spells in exile that were created as a creature became prepared.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','If a prepared creature loses all abilities, it won''t stop being prepared, and nothing will happen to its alternative characteristics or to the copy of its prepare spell in exile.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','If an effect causes a creature to become unprepared, a prepared creature stops being prepared and the associated copy of its prepare spell in exile ceases to exist. If it wasn''t prepared at that time, nothing happens.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','Casting a copy of a prepare spell from exile isn''t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to a copy of a prepare spell cast from exile.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative prepare spell''s name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','A creature with a prepare spell can''t become prepared more than once at the same time. For example, Emeritus of Ideation is on the battlefield and is prepared. When it attacks, its last ability triggers. When that ability resolves, its controller may still exile eight cards from their graveyard, but doing so won''t cause Emeritus of Ideation to become prepared a second time or create a second copy of Ancestral Recall in exile.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','Creating a copy of a creature''s prepare spell in exile ignores copy exceptions applied to that creature that would affect the copiable values of that spell. For example, say a player casts Croaking Counterpart (a sorcery that says "Create a token that''s a copy of target non-Frog creature, except it''s a 1/1 green Frog.") targeting Goblin Glasswright. The token copy of Goblin Glasswright will enter prepared as a 1/1 green Frog creature, but the copy of Craft with Pride in exile will still be a red sorcery. The copy of Craft with Pride won''t be green, a creature, or a Frog, and it won''t have power or toughness.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','As an effect causes a creature with a prepare spell to become prepared (including effects that state that a creature "enters prepared"), that creature''s controller creates a copy of that creature''s prepare spell in exile. That copy remains in exile for as long as that permanent is on the battlefield and is prepared. That creature''s controller may cast that copy as long as it remains in exile. As they cast it, that creature stops being prepared.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','A creature without a prepare spell can''t become prepared.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','Preparation cards can only be cast with their base characteristics.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','A preparation card is a creature card in every zone. For example, while it''s in your graveyard, Emeritus of Ideation is a blue creature whose mana value is 5. It can''t be the target of Zealous Lorecaster''s triggered ability ("When this creature enters, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.").');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','If a prepared creature stops being a creature, it will still be prepared, and the copy of its prepare spell will remain in exile. That permanent''s controller will still be able to cast it. The same is true if a prepared creature becomes a copy of something else, even if it''s then a permanent without a prepare spell.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','If a prepare spell with one or more targets has no legal targets when it tries to resolve, it won''t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Since the spell was cast, the associated permanent will still not be prepared.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('02125db4-4507-467a-ac0c-406de2c7d533','2026-03-20','wotc','Being prepared isn''t a copiable value. If a permanent becomes a copy of a prepared creature, it won''t be prepared. That permanent will have the alternative characteristics, though, and some other effect could cause it to become prepared later.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0b67c4e2-f88b-4e01-85a1-9d5f5b8db13b','2020-11-10','wotc','If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander''s Sphere''s first ability produces no mana. It doesn''t produce {C}.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0b67c4e2-f88b-4e01-85a1-9d5f5b8db13b','2020-11-10','wotc','If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0b67c4e2-f88b-4e01-85a1-9d5f5b8db13b','2020-11-10','wotc','If you don''t have a commander, Commander''s Sphere''s first ability produces no mana.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838','2020-11-10','wotc','If you don''t have a commander, Arcane Signet''s ability produces no mana.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838','2020-11-10','wotc','If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838','2020-11-10','wotc','If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet''s ability produces no mana. It doesn''t produce {C}.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('1593ea18-2f2f-4ab4-83fb-6ccc0bec8a90','2004-12-01','wotc','You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('234a734b-ba28-4f1b-9d01-3c3e7d516590','2022-04-29','wotc','If the target is no longer legal as An Offer You Can''t Refuse resolves, no Treasure tokens are created.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('234a734b-ba28-4f1b-9d01-3c3e7d516590','2022-04-29','wotc','If the target is still legal as it resolves but the spell can''t be countered for some reason, its controller will still create two Treasure tokens.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('25877c41-39a4-4cc3-ac4b-8f3dd06d579b','2026-03-20','wotc','If a prepared creature stops being a creature, it will still be prepared, and the copy of its prepare spell will remain in exile. That permanent''s controller will still be able to cast it. The same is true if a prepared creature becomes a copy of something else, even if it''s then a permanent without a prepare spell.');
INSERT INTO rulings (oracle_id,published_at,source,comment) VALUES ('25877c41-39a4-4cc3-ac4b-8f3dd06d579b','2026-03-20','wotc','While copies of spells in zones other than the stack cease to exist when state-based actions are checked, this does not apply to copies of prepare spells in exile that were created as a creature became prepared.');
